# Rover 25 five-door hatchback, 1999-2005.
#
# The facelifted Rover 200: 3,995 mm long, 1,688 mm wide, 1,415 mm high,
# 2,500 mm wheelbase; 1.4-1.8 petrol and 2.0 diesel. The volume Rover of the
# MG Rover years. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rover_25
#
# Colours: Nightfire Red, Tahiti Blue, Zircon Silver and Arden Green are period
# Rover finishes.
#
# Weight: 120 in total (red 40, blue 30, silver 28, green 22).
#
# Speed 190 km/h; comfort 100/330 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1999-2005 with a road tail to about 2015.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rover-25.blend. References:
# citycars/references/rover-25/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
name=Rover25(NightfireRed)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=40
intro_year=1999
intro_month=10
retire_year=2015
retire_month=6
speed=190
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=100
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=330

